                                "sense_id": "cc12f2ca-0c80-3a5c-867a-83915b2bfba8",
                                "text": "My mothers maydes when they did ſowe & ſpyñ\nthey ſang ſometyme a ſong of the feld mowſe\nthat forbicauſe her lyvelood was but thyñ\nWould nedes goo ſeke her townyſſh ſyſters howſe"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74c9af84-1c8f-4bcc-91d6-2a1d9e04bc6b",
                                "sense_id": "cc12f2ca-0c80-3a5c-867a-83915b2bfba8",
                                "text": "In stature passing all the rest,\nA gallant girl for hewe;\nTo be compared to townish nymphs,\nSo faire she was to viewe."
